# No trailing slash: in a git worktree the built reference driver is usually a
# SYMLINK back to the main tree's build (the build output is not tracked, so a
# fresh worktree has none). `_m88m_build/` matches only a real directory, so
# the symlink showed up as untracked — and, worse, its absence is silent:
# batch-compare.mjs reports "errors: 353/353" with our side "ok", which reads
# like a sweep result rather than a missing instrument.
_m88m_build
